{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useQueryClient(id?: string): QueryClient;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/useQueryClient.ts#L27","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/vue-query/src/useQueryClient.ts:27"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Retrieves the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":" installed by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VueQueryPlugin"},{"type":"text","value":", via Vue's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"inject"},{"type":"text","value":". Must be called inside\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setup()"},{"type":"text","value":" or another function that supports an injection context."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"id","children":[{"type":"text","value":"id?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"''"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queryClientKey"},{"type":"text","value":" passed to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VueQueryPlugin"},{"type":"text","value":" — only needed when multiple "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":"s are\ninstalled in the same app."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../classes/QueryClient.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The installed "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"throws","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Throws"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If called outside an injection context, or if no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":" was installed via\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"VueQueryPlugin"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { useQueryClient } from '@tanstack/vue-query'\n\nconst queryClient = useQueryClient()\n\nfunction invalidate() {\n  queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ['todos'] })\n}\n</script>","lang":"vue"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"id","text":"id?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"throws","text":"Throws","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useQueryClient(id?: string): QueryClient;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-query/src/useQueryClient.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/useQueryClient.ts#L27)\n\nRetrieves the `QueryClient` installed by `VueQueryPlugin`, via Vue's `inject`. Must be called inside\n`setup()` or another function that supports an injection context.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### id?\n\n`string` = `''`\n\nThe `queryClientKey` passed to `VueQueryPlugin` — only needed when multiple `QueryClient`s are\ninstalled in the same app.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nThe installed `QueryClient`.\n\n## Throws\n\nIf called outside an injection context, or if no `QueryClient` was installed via\n`VueQueryPlugin`.\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { useQueryClient } from '@tanstack/vue-query'\n\nconst queryClient = useQueryClient()\n\nfunction invalidate() {\n  queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ['todos'] })\n}\n</script>\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useQueryClient\ntitle: useQueryClient\nredirect_from:\n  - framework/vue/reference/useQueryClient\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useQueryClient(id?: string): QueryClient;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-query/src/useQueryClient.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/vue-query/src/useQueryClient.ts#L27)\n\nRetrieves the `QueryClient` installed by `VueQueryPlugin`, via Vue's `inject`. Must be called inside\n`setup()` or another function that supports an injection context.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### id?\n\n`string` = `''`\n\nThe `queryClientKey` passed to `VueQueryPlugin` — only needed when multiple `QueryClient`s are\ninstalled in the same app.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\n\nThe installed `QueryClient`.\n\n## Throws\n\nIf called outside an injection context, or if no `QueryClient` was installed via\n`VueQueryPlugin`.\n\n## Example\n\n```vue\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { useQueryClient } from '@tanstack/vue-query'\n\nconst queryClient = useQueryClient()\n\nfunction invalidate() {\n  queryClient.invalidateQueries({ queryKey: ['todos'] })\n}\n</script>\n```\n"}
